{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Story</u>: After long ago events, Jack returned to his parents' home, which was now his own. Memories of what he had seen as a child kept him awake, and he decided to revisit the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636000/extras/1-gif.gif?t=1740467085\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The house where his parents had been murdered before his eyes seemed to call to him. It fed on Jack's pain, drove him crazy. But as time passed, the pain didn't subside, it only grew worse. Jack wanted to find answers to finally calm his inner pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636000/extras/gif-3.gif?t=1740467085\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main gameplay is dedicated to the past of the main character - Jack. He relives the events he observed in his childhood. The longer Jack stays in the house, the deeper he delves into his memories, getting closer to solving the mystery associated with his father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636000/extras/2-gif.gif?t=1740467085\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Game Features</u><strong>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Exciting story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A game in the genre of \u201cwalking simulator\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The mystery of the old house, which can be solved by studying old records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A frightening atmosphere created by sound effects that cause a constant sense of presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Beautiful picture that conveys the plausibility of what is happening.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2636000?t=1740467085","background_raw":"h